{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2008-common-biology-03","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2008,"subject":"biology","number":3,"points":null,"unitId":"micro","unitLabel":"미생물·바이러스","topic":"세균·항생제·세균막","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["micro"],"stem":"다음은어항속온도계의표면에붙어있는세균막(biofilm)의\n특성을조사한실험이다.\n<실험과정>\n(가) 온도계표면에부착된세균중한종을분리하여배양하였다.\n(나) (가)의세균을3개의시험관에같은수로넣고각각다른\n속도에서진탕배양하였다.\n(다) 각시험관에서세균의성장형태와항생제X의최소살균\n농도를구하였다.\n<실험결과>\n시험관\n1\n2\n3\n진탕배양기의회전속도\n저속\n중속\n고속\n세균의성장형태\n항생제X의최소살균농도\n50,000\n5,000\n50\n(µg/ml)\n이에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 저속에서형성된세균막은죽은세균이쌓인것이다.\nㄴ. 세균이세균막을형성하면항생제에대한저항성이커진다.\nㄷ. 배양액에항생제X를많이첨가할수록세균막형성이촉진\n된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t031"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t032"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t035"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":772,"height":813,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,48.068,308.8,325.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-common-biology-03/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":779,"height":226,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,411.668,311.6,90.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-common-biology-03/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":2,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.732,416.5,705.865],"width":333.756,"height":55